Description: Lightweight fullscreen kiosk web browser
 gKiosk is a GTK3/WebKit2 kiosk browser for Linux that displays a
 fullscreen web page. Ideal for digital signage, point-of-sale displays,
 and dedicated web terminals. Features persistent cookies for login
 sessions and Xbox/gamepad controller navigation support.
